    {
      "id": "1edtech-lti",
      "title": "1EdTech Learning Tools Interoperability (LTI)",
      "url": "https://www.1edtech.org/standards/lti",
      "source_type": "authoritative",
      "license": "1EdTech public specification; free to implement, certification/trademark use requires 1EdTech membership",
      "retrieved": "2026-09-27",
      "version": "LTI 1.3 / Advantage",
      "local_path": null,
      "notes": "Standard for launching external learning tools from an LMS with authenticated context. Well-established industry standard (also confirmed present as Moodle's `mod/lti`); this pass could not independently re-verify the publisher page live (sandboxed network blocked the fetch), so confidence is kept medium rather than high pending a live re-check."
